{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52809","headline":"游法华寺 · 李邕","name":"游法华寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山势转深看更好，岭霞谿雾没楼台。\n异时花向阴崖发，远处泉从青壁来。\n世界自知千古促，贤愚悉被四时催。\n须知此地堪终老，七窍终成一片灰。\n（见《会稽掇英总集》卷八）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李邕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52809.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52809","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}